"What are the key features and clinical significance of Hemoglobin E Disorders, including their interaction with β-thalassemia?","<bos><start_of_turn>user
What are the key features and clinical significance of Hemoglobin E Disorders, including their interaction with β-thalassemia?<end_of_turn>
