9. Reduced Healthcare Costs: In some cases, CAM can be used to reduce healthcare costs by improving patient compliance and reducing the need for certain medications or procedures.

10. Improved Patient Satisfaction: Patients who incorporate CAM into their care may experience increased quality of life and overall satisfaction. This can lead to a stronger relationship between patient and healthcare provider.

Thus, nurses advocate for CAPA due to their holistic approach to life, patient preference, potential benefits, and growing research supporting its effectiveness.
