","The selective demethylation of promoters by MBD2/dMTase is influenced by several factors, including the DNA sequence context, the presence of other regulatory factors, and the chromatin environment. MBD2/dMTase does not affect all promoters equally because it recognizes and binds to specific DNA sequences and interacts with other proteins that influence its activity.

