P = nFE_cell

Where n is the number of electrons transferred (2 for this reaction) and F is the Faraday constant (96,485 C/mol).

P = (2 mol)(96,485 C/mol)(+0.2808 V)
P ≈ 55,000 J/mol

The power output of the galvanic cell is approximately 55,000 J/mol.
