8. **Experimental Validation:** If possible, compare the CFD results with experimental data for the same or similar airfoys to validate the accuracy of the CFD simulation.

By following these steps, you will be able to determine the flow characteristics, pressure coefficients, and critical angle of attachment for the given airfoil.
