\]

Simplify the logarithmic term:

\[
\ln (10^5) = \frac{E_a}{2} \left( 0.0006 \right)
\]

\[
5 = \frac{E_a}{2} \left( 0.0006 \right)
\]

Solve for \( E_a \):

\[
E_a = \frac{5}{0.0006} \times 2 = 8333.33 \, \text{cal mol}^{-1}
\]

