\]
Since \( F_{\text{fr}} \) and \( v \) are functions of time, the entropy production rate simplifies to:
\[
\frac{\partial F_{\text{fr}}}{\partial t} \cdot v + F_{\text{fr}} \cdot \frac{\partial v}{\partial t} \cdot \frac{1}{T}
\]
